yle=\"background:var(--btn-bg);color:var(--btn-fg);border-radius:var(--r-btn)\">Search</button></form></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\"><p>© <span>2026</span> <span>Pursae</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.02;font-size:clamp(24px, 3.00cqi, 36px)\"><h1>WordPress, at the speed of Go</h1></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\" style=\"justify-self:stretch\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.75] [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:my-5 [&amp;_h2]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:mt-10 [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.6em] [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:leading-tight [&amp;_h3]:mb-2 [&amp;_h3]:mt-8 [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.3em] [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mt-6 [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_ul]:my-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-6 [&amp;_ol]:my-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-6 [&amp;_li]:my-1 [&amp;_blockquote]:my-7 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-(--line) [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-5 [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_img]:h-auto [&amp;_img]:max-w-full [&amp;_figure]:my-7 [&amp;_figcaption]:mt-2 [&amp;_figcaption]:text-[14px] [&amp;_figcaption]:text-(--muted) [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_pre]:my-6 [&amp;_pre]:overflow-x-auto [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.9em] [&amp;_hr]:my-10 [&amp;_hr]:border-(--line) [&amp;_table]:my-6 [&amp;_table]:w-full [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:border-(--line) [&amp;_td]:p-2 [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:border-(--line) [&amp;_th]:p-2\"><p>Pursae keeps the parts of WordPress people rely on and rewrites the rest in Go: one binary, one PostgreSQL database and plugins that run in a WebAssembly sandbox.</p>\n<h2>Why a rewrite?</h2>\n<p>Most sites spend their time waiting on PHP workers and on the database. A compiled server with a connection pool answers the same pages with a fraction of the memory.</p>\n<ul><li>The dashboard and the block editor work as before.</li><li>Themes and menus keep their familiar shape.</li><li>Caching is built in.</li></ul>\n<blockquote><p>We moved forty sites in an afternoon and our hosting bill halved.</p></blockquote>\n<p>Read the migration guide to move an existing site, or start fresh with the built-in theme.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65\"><p>One binary, one database and a sandbox for plugins: what changes when the core is compiled.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\" style=\"justify-self:stretch\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"Hands typing on a laptop with a web interface open\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1782898669223-ab17b600d486?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80\" width=\"1400\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"block size-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.6;border-radius:var(--r-card)\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\"><p class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center ga